{"title":"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 24","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_24\">Problem 24</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 24\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/7/3c76c59a0d2c808b08fdc7b54fe3480f62bf71db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2-12x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" />: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/9/eb9e4e30a56ae267da650fe54967df0e91f22526.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{always increases as }x\\text{ increases}\\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{always decreases as }x\\text{ decreases to 1}\\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{cannot equal 0}\\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{has a maximum value when }x\\text{ is negative}\\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{has a minimum value of-10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"334\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the process of elimination to narrow down the field substantially:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/8/0c8d2f8b438641fb40bf30b36d5ef0f3d26aeb80.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{always increases as } x\\text{ increases}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"257\" height=\"17\" /> is wrong due to the quadratic nature of the function.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/d/c1d2c83eb5e0ac6ed9fc121a81dc02d80226e9eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{always decreases as } x\\text{ decreases to 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"295\" height=\"17\" /> is wrong due to the vertex being on the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d3f56dd6373415b932ab99e82c6c2aa08a013a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> would decrease all the way to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d3f56dd6373415b932ab99e82c6c2aa08a013a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" />, but increase from there.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff4f14e733568deb0a3a4b7bb5ff2e56ce9d7404.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{cannot equal 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"140\" height=\"17\" /> is wrong due to the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Discriminant\" title=\"Discriminant\">discriminant</a> being greater than zero.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/a/23af56e6ccfe390789adb69e717ca3f4a8060185.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{has a maximum value when}\\ x \\text{ is negative}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"334\" height=\"17\" /> is wrong due to the function not having a maximum value (the function opens up, so the vertex is the minimum value).\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e41e3cd48cee2c6866cfbb4386a8e99d3482f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"29\" height=\"18\" /> is the correct answer (this can be verified by plugging in 1.5 (the x-coordinate of the vertex) in).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME\" title=\"1955 AHSME\">1955 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1955 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1955\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1955_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1955 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wik